# Process many issues hands-off in a row

Run this to **process a queue of issues hands-off** with a single up-front confirmation — the batch equivalent of `/iflow-yolo`. Each issue runs the full yolo chain (`capture → plan → build → close yolo`, PR auto-merged); the cycle interrupts you only when input is **strictly necessary**.

Best when every queued issue is yolo-fit (small, low-risk, well-specified, test-guarded). Issues the queue tags `yolo: false` still run, on the **non-yolo lane** (same chain, same safeguards; merge per `nonyolo:` policy, default **`{{ cycle_nonyolo }}`**).

